# Database

- Persistent player state lives in PostgreSQL, not the Render filesystem.
- Schema changes require a version-controlled migration.
- Released migrations are immutable.
- Never commit dumps, backups, or student records.
- In-memory repositories are for tests and early demos only, using the same interfaces.
